{
  "article_id": "3580480498-2247494691_1",
  "title": "6.18又要来了",
  "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/6vJ9pIi8htCQmsynZLQGIQ",
  "publish_time": 1746264684,
  "status": "body_recovered",
  "extraction_method": "article_dom",
  "body_text": "一进5月，这一年又过去一半\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n我还沉浸在每天晒豆子测豆子和找寻捡漏便宜基础豆的日常中\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n同事提起今年6.18我们咋个整，卖啥\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n问题很好，但下回别问了，直接出个方案给我好了，我不想动脑袋想前面的过程，就想做个点头Yes摇头No的老板～（哈哈哈哈）\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n大概率，这次大促会有\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n一个酒桶系列产品（橡木桶内的鲜果发酵，橡木桶内的生豆静置，葡萄酒装瓶时的酒泥用于咖啡的发酵尝试）分享包形式\n夏季拼配\n新豆子若干\n订阅开放\n‍\n满赠的细节和小礼品等过两周海报出来再发布，\n可能有一个我们在宁夏做的葡萄酒加入大礼包，还有一件我们今年做的短袖*_\nCoE试点赛的装修工作开始了～办一次比赛真的是大大大工程，就在我码字的现在，基地对接赞助商的小伙伴还在跟一个金主在调整现场展板部分，老板找钱来不容易，还有各级主管协办单位的各种指导建议要甄选接纳执行，给每一位佐园的牛马们（包括给上级单位汇报工作的老板）点赞！！！\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n今天基地小伙伴们（阿梦和大妈），整理室内房间，清洗和安放各种用具，中间穿插着接待各路访客，以及打包和销售零散生豆；\n‍\n‍\n（阿梦）忙的差不多了，做一杯拿铁休息下～😄\n表叔和大表姐承包了最大的室外场地的清洗工作，为了让大家在室外的时候更凉快一些，老板给晒棚顶部又安装了一层遮阳网，真有用唉，今天太阳出来后在棚下都觉得没啥热感了\n老板娘在率领着娘子军们赶工挑豆子，可能比赛期间挑豆子工作就要暂停了\n还有2天就开赛咯～今年肯定会有很好喝的豆子！\n而且，比赛这2周肯定会有很好吃的饭，据说明天又要杀牛了～\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<mp-common-clmusic albumurl=\"http://wx.y.gtimg.cn/music/photo_new/T002R500x500M000003dqGbI0OZ5ZU_2.jpg\" avatar=\"\" class=\"clmusic_iframe res_iframe js_uneditable custom_select_card\" count=\"0\" data-pluginname=\"insertaudio\" duration=\"318000\" is_vip=\"1\" listenid=\"78221539629087488\" music_name=\"OH NO,OH YES!\" music_source=\"1\" singer=\"竹内まりや\" type=\"1\" username=\"\">\n</mp-common-clmusic>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          一进5月，这一年又过去一半\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我还沉浸在每天晒豆子测豆子和找寻捡漏便宜基础豆的日常中\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          同事提起今年6.18我们咋个整，卖啥\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          问题很好，但下回别问了，直接出个方案给我好了，我不想动脑袋想前面的过程，就想做个点头Yes摇头No的老板～（哈哈哈哈）\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          大概率，这次大促会有\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            一个酒桶系列产品（橡木桶内的鲜果发酵，橡木桶内的生豆静置，葡萄酒装瓶时的酒泥用于咖啡的发酵尝试）分享包形式\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            夏季拼配\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            新豆子若干\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            订阅开放\n           </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          满赠的细节和小礼品等过两周海报出来再发布，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(214, 214, 214);\">\n          可能有一个我们在宁夏做的葡萄酒加入大礼包，还有一件我们今年做的短袖*_\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T4I7RgAgSbFVFiaoS3icZWUKs0ibwicXPkqo7EibOAiaBFnHIPnic0DkSw4PQwOIwzrO6M1OeKbnV61yzhg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(214, 214, 214);\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          CoE试点赛的装修工作开始了～办一次比赛真的是大大大工程，就在我码字的现在，基地对接赞助商的小伙伴还在跟一个金主在调整现场展板部分，老板找钱来不容易，还有各级主管协办单位的各种指导建议要甄选接纳执行，给每一位佐园的牛马们（包括给上级单位汇报工作的老板）点赞！！！\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T4I7RgAgSbFVFiaoS3icZWUKVkvB5Mh7zQakyNzZEiaywertWtjTMGZGefPEt5xrD9TY1gfyWIakv2Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          今天基地小伙伴们（阿梦和大妈），整理室内房间，清洗和安放各种用具，中间穿插着接待各路访客，以及打包和销售零散生豆；\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T4I7RgAgSbFVFiaoS3icZWUKtu9unuibfxcaucmo3Kbwm3yzibLuOTn2oVJNrlVyhXU9GudYLKqHqTcw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          （阿梦）忙的差不多了，做一杯拿铁休息下～😄\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T4I7RgAgSbFVFiaoS3icZWUKUJPB924dZd78X4LrcAKuCIG0o2OQYcPxSHbzJPYpat7rcGyNC9aBWg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          表叔和大表姐承包了最大的室外场地的清洗工作，为了让大家在室外的时候更凉快一些，老板给晒棚顶部又安装了一层遮阳网，真有用唉，今天太阳出来后在棚下都觉得没啥热感了\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T4I7RgAgSbFVFiaoS3icZWUKp62RFPpAY398SrQS3lGAmZQIlfjG52AAY3TdHLuicUOLLiawFtJCJdzw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          老板娘在率领着娘子军们赶工挑豆子，可能比赛期间挑豆子工作就要暂停了\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T4I7RgAgSbFVFiaoS3icZWUKLqJVMawicf1ia4BPlILRhouQYkMCa4ib2JiaNgI68o83icBjBLUoNKwrsbg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          还有2天就开赛咯～今年肯定会有很好喝的豆子！\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          而且，比赛这2周肯定会有很好吃的饭，据说明天又要杀牛了～\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
